  "description": "Sian Lee is fated to die in May, the same month her family was massacred. As the curse draws near, a dangerous man named Gon Tae offers to save her. \"Say it,\" he whispers. \"Tell me you want to live.\" In his obsession, all he asks in return is a promise to share life and death with him.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
